    managerUnlockCost: 0
    submanagers: []
  - id: the_living_sacrifice
    displayName: The Living Sacrifice
    flavorText: Believers are called to present their bodies as a living sacrifice,
      exercising their differing gifts within one body and bearing with one another
      in love rather than judgment.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Turns from doctrine to practice, calling believers to present themselves
      as a living sacrifice, exercise their differing spiritual gifts within the
      one body of Christ, love genuinely, submit to governing authorities, fulfill
      the law through love of neighbor, and bear with one another's differing convictions
      on disputable matters (food, days) without judging, following the example of
      Christ, "who pleased not himself."
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_romans
    managerId: the_living_sacrifice
